# 4. FREE MODEL CLASSIFICATION AND VERIFICATION

Every discovered model must be classified correctly.

Create these access categories:

1. FREE_HOSTED_UNLIMITED — only when officially confirmed without usage limits.
2. FREE_HOSTED_QUOTA — free requests or tokens subject to limits.
3. FREE_DAILY_LIMIT — daily or periodic free allowance.
4. FREE_CREDIT — promotional credits, not permanent free access.
5. FREE_OPEN_WEIGHT — model weights are freely available, but hardware and hosting may cost money.
6. LOCAL_FREE — usable locally without paid inference APIs.
7. PAID_ONLY — requires payment.
8. UNAVAILABLE — currently inaccessible.
9. RETIRED — no longer supported.
10. UNKNOWN — not verified.

Never label a model as FREE merely because its weights are downloadable.

For every model record:

